    "sub_name": "產學合作倫理",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS AND PROFESSIONAL ETHICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的為學習並了解相關產學合作倫理。課程內容注重在工程師個人倫理與產業倫理，工程師的權利與責任，協調溝通的方法與技巧，智慧財產的法律與管理。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to learn and understand relevant industry-university cooperation ethics. The content of the course focuses on the personal ethics and industrial ethics of engineers, the rights and responsibilities of engineers, the methods and skills of coordination and communication, and the law and management of the intellectual property.",
